                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5764ef5c-d234-31d1-9bd1-5a3c0914f600",
                        "entry_id": "16edd679-a9fb-3e85-a8d4-20cb67a60599",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A man who is not a father."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "663dc810-d0b7-4eea-97b4-98575951d404",
                                "sense_id": "5764ef5c-d234-31d1-9bd1-5a3c0914f600",
                                "text": "But this delugic force is not truly akin to those unfathers until Wordsworth recovers from total loss and, in a moment of specular identification, recognizes in that errant power the face of his own soul: \"And now recovering, to my Soul I say/'I recognise thy glory'\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6aaa790b-65ee-4027-9ecd-c45fa9dbd906",
                                "sense_id": "5764ef5c-d234-31d1-9bd1-5a3c0914f600",
                                "text": "With the increasing numbers of unfathers and unmothers, churches need ceremonies that aid acceptance, thank medical professionals for valiant attempts, promote courage to face a childless future and remind them of the omnipresence of the Therapeutic Presence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "130ab7b4-9583-4f8a-80df-b9e0a8450e36",
                                "sense_id": "5764ef5c-d234-31d1-9bd1-5a3c0914f600",
                                "text": "Instead of three fathers rooting for me when I made my processional entrance into the football stadium and onto an immense green field to collect my empty diploma case, there was Rudy, an unfather, somewhere in a blurry sea of cardinal red"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "c04fdfed-0e05-3547-a909-6799dc70ecd0",
